{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","炽焰骑射"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，诡草会在战场上移动攻击；主动释放时，进行一轮扫射并且使用“碎裂弹”强化后续的普通攻击。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，诡草会持续在场上移动攻击，若被控制则8秒内无法移动攻击。攻击速度和急速不会影响自身的动作速度，每1点攻击速度或急速使自身暴击增幅提升2点。\n使用终极技能时会对扇形范围的敌人扫射，发射6发贯穿战场的子弹，每发对路径上的敌人造成280% + 40% ATK伤害，随后自身会装填“碎裂弹”，普通攻击对目标造成180% ATK伤害，对目标身后1格扇形范围的其他敌人造成40% ATK溅射伤害，直至自身被控制。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":120,"end":126,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":116,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":155,"end":163,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":184,"end":191,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","扫射时，每次对路径上的敌人造成伤害提升至290% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","扫射时，每次对路径上的敌人造成伤害提升至300% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","扫射时，每次对路径上的敌人造成伤害提升至310% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","扫射时，每次对路径上的敌人造成伤害提升至320% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","坚守领域"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","诡草提升暴击，并在受到控制时免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，诡草提高10 + 2点暴击。诡草会在受到控制效果时释放本技能，免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","释放本技能时，立即回复120% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","被动获得的暴击提升至12 + 2点。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","被动获得的暴击提升至15 + 2点。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","震荡爆击"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","击退靠近的敌人并造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对距离2格以内的敌人释放，装填“震击弹”，造成220% + 25% ATK伤害，并将其击退2格。装填“碎裂弹”期间无法使用本技能。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至250% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击增幅，装填“碎裂弹”期间进一步提升暴击增幅。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高22点暴击增幅。且当装填“碎裂弹”期间，额外提升8点暴击增幅。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高30点暴击增幅。且当装填“碎裂弹”期间，额外提升10点暴击增幅。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高38点暴击增幅。且当装填“碎裂弹”期间，额外提升12点暴击增幅。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","疾驰狂怒"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","持续移动一段时间后，装填“碎裂弹”强化后续的普通攻击。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","诡草在场上移动时会逐渐提升移动速度，在5秒后达到最大速度并为自身装填“碎裂弹”。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“碎裂弹”对目标造成伤害提升至220% ATK，溅射伤害提升至50% ATK，溅射范围提升至目标身后2格扇形范围。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“碎裂弹”对目标造成伤害提升至230% ATK，溅射伤害提升至55% ATK，溅射范围提升至目标身后2格扇形范围。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“碎裂弹”对目标造成伤害提升至240% ATK，溅射伤害提升至60% ATK，溅射范围提升至目标身后2格扇形范围。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“坚守领域”的冷却时间降低。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“坚守领域”的冷却时间降低3秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","终极技能的时间停止效果延长到所有子弹发射完毕后。若释放终极技能时自身已经装填了“碎裂弹”，则使自身额外提升120点暴击增幅和60%的移动速度，直至自身被控制。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","爆裂火铳"]]}